emory (global-memory/MEMORY.md)\n\n<!-- Cap: 2,500 chars. Working scratchpad; writes take effect next session. -->\r\n# Working Memory\r\n\r\n## Active Threads (max 5; park one to add one)\r\n- **Status report**: biweekly to 12/18. →Tier A supervisor-log-pipeline\r\n- **SW/Tech Review (10/1)**: Erin asked; NEXT Teams 10/2, ET by 11/30. →`SoftwareTech_Review/docs/`\r\n- **Ship queue (9/25)**: q2wk to a named user: RI5 #002 wk 9/28, intern M1 10/9, AP Digest ch1 10/23 (draft PR #1, Performance_Playbook). →`RunningTheRoom/docs/STATUS.md`\r\n- **PP Recruiting (9/30)**: 017 sent-ready; 018 SHIP. NEXT send 018, walkthrough. →`PP_Recruiting/docs/`\r\n- **RTP CLA (9/26)**: L1–2 built. NEXT Tim/Jacob export; Joe → L3. →`RTP_Constraints_Course/docs/`\r\n\r\n## Parked (NEXT lives in each STATUS.md; `where-was-i.py` lists them)\r\n- 5S5M (10/6): all 45 decks on main; NEXT fill referral path [ADD] 18/20/39/42/43 →EAI STATUS\r\n- PM system BUILT 10/3: live board `/pm`, resume cards, Friday sweep, card-check; slate cleared; guide merged (`docs/GUIDE.md`); NEXT restart CC, `pm`, GUIDE walkthrough →`project-triage/docs/STATUS.md`\r\n- Personal site: scroll-craft LOCAL, Artifact live →Tier A personal-site-build-routes\r\n- FB matchups: W5 ASU done, W1-4 backfilled; `pff_game_result.py`; bye wk = mid-season →`MatchupAnalysis_FB2026`\r\n- Flint: Supertraining Ch1-7 in vault (10/3); NEXT Ch8 on Mac →`Flint`\r\n- 42Analytics: NEXT captions (429s) on Mac →`42Analytics`\r\n- VB GRID: fix merged 10/2 (#2); await Mike's reply →`Volleyball_GRID`\r\n- Sleep sched: NEXT night/early-kickoff →`sleep-scheduler`\r\n- TypeSafe: MAINTENANCE; PR #31 merged as record →`TypeSafe_Sandbox`\r\n\r\n## Environment Notes\r\n- Machine split (9/24): Win=day, Mac=eve; Mac sole writer GPS/Perch/VALD.\r\n- Hooks: patch both copies for shared events. →Tier A hook-two-copies-trap.\r\n- daily-backup: manifest entries alone copy nothing; sweep nested ~/.claude repos →handoff 09-19.\r\n- `DEV/Linda Projects` = private I-983 repo; folder has a space, repo an underscore.\r\n- `~/DEV` = THIN repo; `.gitignore` starts `/*` — never remove. →Tier A github-consolidation.\r\n- Win: Drive sync, junction and renv traps →machine.md. PFF: swap Parquet on Drive, never the DB; `PFF_DB`.\r\n- Schedules →automation-cadence. CFB capture Mac only. Dashboard →command-centre.\r\n- Post-merge: delete merged branches unasked (verify) →Tier A post-merge-cleanup.\r\n- Sessions: start `where-was-i.py`, prune with `session-sweep.py` →Tier A session-hygiene.\r\n\r\n## Pending Decisions\r\n- None open.\n\n---\n\n## HOOK FAILURES — surface these to the user on the first response\n\n- **memsearch-sync** ×1 (2026-10-06 19:02 → 2026-10-06 19:02 UTC): index Milvus unreachable 6x consecutively — indexing may not be keeping up: 2026-10-06 13:59:14,103 [WARNING][_recover]: Connection recovery failed (connection_manager.py:672)\n- 2 unparsed line(s); see the file.\n\nFull log: `~/.claude/global-memory/transcripts/.errors.log`. Surface this once; clear the file after the user has seen it and the cause is handled.\n\n---\n\n## Cross-harness activity (KeystoneOS unified snapshot)\n\nNot loaded here — read it only if a question needs it.\nPath: `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV\\KeystoneOS\\outputs\\dashboard\\unified-snapshot.md` (7053 chars, updated 2026-08-14 12:54)\n## Today\nTuesday, October 06, 2026\n\n---\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n230 compiled articles (180 concepts, 50 connections, 0 qa). The index is NOT loaded here — read it only when a question actually needs it:\n- Full index (article, summary, sources, updated): `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\claude-memory-compiler\\knowledge\\index.md`\n- Article bodies: `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\claude-memory-compiler\\knowledge/<folder>/<name>.md`\n- Search across all memory instead of reading the index: `memsearch search \"<query>\" --top-k 5`\n\n---\n\n## Recent Daily Log\n\nLatest: `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude\\claude-memory-compiler\\daily\\2026-10-06.md`. N