{"parentUuid":"d797fab3-5066-42bf-a69d-70f7cbb19bc8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfmaBPJMAviarAsDkzpBS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":998,"cache_read_input_tokens":99700,"output_tokens":1104,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":215},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":998,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1104,"cache_read_input_tokens":99700,"cache_creation_input_tokens":998,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":998},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":9459,"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfmaBNh8q3wgkSgG8M6HN","type":"assistant","uuid":"899ebc3f-12b2-4fb3-819f-84337fc6f445","timestamp":"2026-10-06T19:56:50.069Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"d1673601-88f7-4fb0-b59a-00f5414c1656","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"G:\\My Drive\\00_Primary_Storage_Drive\\02_SPORTS\\Football\\PP_Recruiting\\_exports\\2026_asof_2026-09-29","sessionId":"d1673601-88f7-4fb0-b59a-00f5414c1656","version":"2.1.291","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"899ebc3f-12b2-4fb3-819f-84337fc6f445","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfmaBPJMAviarAsDkzpBS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Eligibility comes straight from Telemetry. It's a column in the Leaderboard CSV exports, and the 2026 files we have on disk do include it.\n\n**How it gets to the Review Board**\n\n1. **Source:** the Telemetry **Leaderboard** export (Player Traits tab and Advanced Stats tab). Every leaderboard view has the same fixed columns before the metrics: `PlayerId, Rank, Player, #, Pos., Class, Elig., Height, Weight, Team, Hometown, State, Snaps`. Eligibility is the 7th column, `Elig.`. This is written up in repo `docs/2026-09-15-review-board-meeting.md` (header row around line 276).\n2. **Load:** the loader renames `Elig.` to PORTAL INPUT's `Elig Yrs` column. That rename is in `scripts/load_leaderboard.py:45` (`\"Elig.\": \"Elig Yrs\"`) and in the Power Query loader in 014 and later (`make_self_service.py`). The same value drives the Min Elig filter (`--min-elig 1`, or the `LoadMinElig` cell on UPDATE DATA).\n3. **Display:** REVIEW BOARD reads Elig Yrs from PORTAL INPUT like any other roster field. Nothing is calculated.\n\n**What the number means:** Telemetry's `Elig.` is the player's *current* years left after this season, even in past-season files. This was checked on 2025-09-15 against 30 of 30 transfers (LOG.md, STATUS.md). So 1+ means still eligible after 2026.\n\n**The 2026 exports on disk do have it.** All 44 CSVs in `_exports/2026_asof_2026-09-29/` (FBS and FCS-G6, traits and advanced stats) carry `Elig.` as column 7. The 9/30 test load also used it to drop 1,918 players below Elig 1.\n\nIf the files you're looking at don't have it, they probably came from somewhere else:\n- **The Transfer Portal grid** (Transfer Portal > Player Traits / Advanced Stats) rather than the **Leaderboard**. The loader is built for the Leaderboard export.\n- **The \"Download Excel\" option** instead of \"Download CSV\". We've only ever checked the CSV's columns.\n\nTell me where the new files are and I'll check their headers. Without an `Elig.` column, the Min Elig filter will drop every player or leave Elig Yrs blank.\n\nAlso, a hook reported a failure this session: memsearch-sync couldn't reach Milvus 6 times in a row (06:59 local on 10/6). Docker Desktop probably isn't running."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":998,"cache_read_input_tokens":99700,"output_tokens":1104,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":215},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":998,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1104,"cache_read_input_tokens":99700,"cache_creation_input_tokens":998,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":998},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfmaBNh8q3wgkSgG8M6HN","type":"assistant","uuid":"ce960f01-5906-40ac-bf52-2b2aee0d6b38","timestamp":"2026-10-06T19:56:50.670Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"d1673601-88f7-4fb0-b59a-00f5414c1656","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"G:\\My Drive\\00_Primary_Storage_Drive\\02_SPORTS\\Football\\PP_Recruiting\\_exports\\2026_asof_2026-09-29","sessionId":"d1673601-88f7-4fb0-b59a-00f5414c1656","version":"2.1.291","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
