{"parentUuid":"7687dc2c-c3df-4dc1-998f-7844aa5a0442","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfmcAeJSdq7U4xGJLzQKC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sounds good. With all the columns turned on, the export should load into 018 the same way the 9/29 files did.\n\nI added a short entry to `LOG.md` saying that Download CSV only exports the columns showing in the view, so every column has to be on before exporting. Eligibility can only come from that `Elig.` column.\n\nTwo other things I found in the 10/6 files are worth passing to your colleague for the re-export:\n\n- **Don't open the CSV in Excel before loading it.** His files had been saved through Excel, which changed heights like `6-0` into dates (`Jun-00`). The loader can't read those, so the players affected would lose their height.\n- **Check the file names.** `QB ADV (26).csv` actually held the traits and `QB TRAITS (26).csv` held the advanced stats."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":472,"cache_read_input_tokens":109238,"output_tokens":291,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":33},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":472,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":291,"cache_read_input_tokens":109238,"cache_creation_input_tokens":472,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":472},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfmcAdz6bdb9iQPGr4BiW","type":"assistant","uuid":"f79ca8e9-f6bc-4f51-aa3a-e1bf01b2f72d","timestamp":"2026-10-06T20:22:47.376Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEf