{"parentUuid":"084f2963-6c0a-480d-9b50-af800621e54c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4b841993-72e3-4854-a61a-b7073d9f14da","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0131NKzFP3sqvk88KJgGeLMY","type":"tool_result","content":"13:Each file is checked as it lands (tab by header, position group by Pos. codes,\n108:    time.sleep(seconds)\n118:        time.sleep(1)\n147:    time.sleep(0.8)\n169:            time.sleep(0.8)\n171:            time.sleep(0.8)\n186:            time.sleep(0.6)\n219:    time.sleep(0.8)\n224:    deadline = time.time() + 60\n225:    while time.time() < deadline:\n236:            time.sleep(0.5)\n238:        time.sleep(0.5)\n251:        raise PullError(f\"expected {tab_key} but header says {'advanced' if is_adv else 'traits'}\")\n297:                  \"Waiting up to 10 minutes for the leaderboard to appear...\", flush=True)\n298:            deadline = time.time() + 600\n299:            while time.time() < deadline:\n302:                        time.sleep(3)\n305:                        time.sleep(3)  # let the session cookies settle before closing\n310:                time.sleep(3)\n322:            sys.exit(\"--season and --out are required\")\n10:  `scripts/telemetry_pull.py` now works end to end: scope fix `20e2de6`; `93e8829`\n75:  as 2025 values. A 44-file refresh took about 2 minutes on this laptop.\n193:   Tell him a refresh takes 2-4 minutes. Week-5 REVIEW + Sample OK by tab (item 0\n260:- `telemetry_pull.py` uses one Chrome profile (`%LOCALAPPDATA%\\telemetry-pull`);\neafc3bd telemetry_pull: add scopes one at a time (3+ chips collapse to \"3 selected\"); 2026 FCS+G6 pulled (22 files)\nea997bd telemetry_pull: several scopes per pull (--scope \"FCS,Group of Six\" --tag fcs-g6); STATUS: Mauro on Windows Excel, FCS+G6 decided\n93e8829 telemetry_pull: keep the page's CSV instead of Chrome's download manager (it crashed Chrome after each download); own downloads folder; manifest merges across reruns\n20e2de6 telemetry