lemetry_pull: keep the page's CSV instead of Chrome's download manager (it crashed Chrome after each download); own downloads folder; manifest merges across reruns\n20e2de6 telemetry_pull: fix scope filter for the current leaderboard UI\n00434dc Add telemetry_pull.py: Playwright CLI that downloads Telemetry leaderboard CSVs (read-only UI clicks, own Chrome profile, per-file checks)","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to G:\\My Drive\\00_Primary_Storage_Drive\\02_SPORTS\\Football\\PP_Recruiting","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"084f2963-6c0a-480d-9b50-af800621e54c","session_id":"d1673601-88f7-4fb0-b59a-00f5414c1656","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"G:\\My Drive\\00_Primary_Storage_Drive\\02_SPORTS\\Football\\PP_Recruiting","sessionId":"d1673601-88f7-4fb0-b59a-00f5414c1656","version":"2.1.291","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
